WEBVTT

00:30:59.496 --> 00:31:03.538
There's a lot of different versions of
what I think is possible there, you know,

00:31:03.579 --> 00:31:06.038
in some sense, I'd argue the merge
has already like begun

00:31:06.329 --> 00:31:09.621
the human technology merge like we have
this thing in our hands that sort of

00:31:09.996 --> 00:31:11.246
dictates a lot of what we think,

00:31:11.246 --> 00:31:15.621
but it gives us real superpowers and
that can go much, much further.

00:31:16.079 --> 00:31:19.871
Maybe it goes all the way to like the
Elon Musk vision of neuro link

00:31:19.871 --> 00:31:21.788
and having our brains plugged
into computers

00:31:21.788 --> 00:31:25.454
and sort of like literally we have a
computer on the back of our head

00:31:25.454 --> 00:31:27.871
or goes the other direction and
we get uploaded into one.

00:31:28.204 --> 00:31:29.579
Or maybe it's just that we all have

00:31:29.579 --> 00:31:33.038
a chat bot that kind of
constantly steers us